[{"id":"30d8584a-9d66-5ed2-80d5-69b191f5380e","type":"document_chunk","content":"# 水泥窑协同处置工艺说明（契约探测语料）","relationship":"contains","weight":1.0,"hop":1},{"id":"b1929b56-577d-5a21-8ae3-0410c925e1d0","type":"document_chunk","content":"一、窑尾温度控制：正常工况下窑尾温度应保持在 1050℃ 至 1150℃ 之间。","relationship":"contains","weight":1.0,"hop":1},{"id":"00d1b7bb-44b8-58b2-816b-3acb852fe718","type":"document_chunk","content":"二、异常处置：当窑尾温度连续 30 分钟低于 1000℃ 时，应触发工艺异常告警并通知中控。","relationship":"contains","weight":1.0,"hop":1},{"id":"34bf5ecb-fe04-5efd-9fc9-a83a3c86a661","type":"document_chunk","content":"三、篦冷机出口熟料温度应低于 65℃ 加环境温度。","relationship":"contains","weight":1.0,"hop":1},{"id":"9ba3ee7b-2dc1-522c-91a0-d1b631808a4c","type":"document_chunk","content":"四、高温津贴按日计发，露天作业人员每人每工作日 15 元。","relationship":"contains","weight":1.0,"hop":1}]